{"id":"n88511-1-10","stage":4,"title":"희미하다 · 渺茫","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88511-1-10-1","ko":"범인의 얼굴이 기억나십니까?","zh":"您还记得凶手的脸吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"범인의","meaning":"犯人，罪犯","explanation":"범인：犯人，罪犯；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"범인","audio":"/audio/29d23f06ebca35bda654.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14455","senseId":"1","lemma":"범인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"범인의","audio":"/audio/a959500b2329fd0e906e.mp3"}},{"text":"얼굴이","meaning":"脸，面孔，脸部","explanation":"얼굴：脸，面孔，脸部；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼굴이","audio":"/audio/81669bb10178aa2a65c6.mp3"}},{"text":"기억나십니까?","meaning":"记起，想起","explanation":"기억나다：记起，想起；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"기억나다","audio":"/audio/2c11a52327c9fb0eab24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17229","senseId":"1","lemma":"기억나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기억나십니까","audio":"/audio/d36e73e81b63fa8c07af.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"29d23f06ebca35bd","term":"범인","zh":"犯人，罪犯","audio":"/audio/29d23f06ebca35bda654.mp3","entryId":"14455","definition":"违反法律、犯了错误的人。","pronunciation":["버ː민"]},{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"脸，面孔，脸部","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"有眼睛、鼻子、嘴的头的前面部分。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]},{"id":"2c11a52327c9fb0e","term":"기억나다","zh":"记起，想起","audio":"/audio/2c11a52327c9fb0eab24.mp3","entryId":"17229","definition":"在心中或脑海里浮现出以前的模样、事实、知识、经验等。","pronunciation":["기엉나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/dbc097e768fe8ffabf0a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n88511-1-10-2","ko":"글쎄요, 기억이 희미해서 생각이 잘 나지 않네요.","zh":"嗯，记忆不太清晰了，想不起来呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"글쎄요,","meaning":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","explanation":"글쎄요：也许吧，或许吧，难说。","readings":[{"term":"글쎄요","audio":"/audio/b6013caa74979f40ee06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60633","senseId":"1","lemma":"글쎄요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글쎄요","audio":"/audio/b6013caa74979f40ee06.mp3"}},{"text":"기억이","meaning":"记着，记住","explanation":"기억：记着，记住；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기억","audio":"/audio/603669bd762779d98169.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38812","senseId":"1","lemma":"기억","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기억이","audio":"/audio/3e1df3e1fc3b5f222699.mp3"}},{"text":"희미해서","meaning":"渺茫，渺然，模糊，朦胧","explanation":"희미하다：渺茫，渺然，模糊，朦胧；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"희미하다","audio":"/audio/ee8319cc180fe99398ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88511","senseId":"1","lemma":"희미하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"희미해서","audio":"/audio/5eac63bbf807a79326e7.mp3"}},{"text":"생각이","meaning":"回想，记忆","explanation":"생각：回想，记忆；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"2","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각이","audio":"/audio/4cbc2bb73481851c34fc.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"清楚地，仔细地","explanation":"잘：清楚地，仔细地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"나지","meaning":"想起，想到","explanation":"나다：想起，想到；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"21","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나지","audio":"/audio/e3dab811a03673c55137.mp3"}},{"text":"않네요.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"e